>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 2026-08-20</p>

  <h2>Editorial line</h2>
  <p>
    FaktumAI is a website for software products, AI-assisted development, and technical project expertise. News, analysis, interviews and tool reviews form the editorial content section. We publish source-backed, technically grounded content and distinguish between claims, interpretations and uncertainties.
  </p>

  <h2>AI-assisted production</h2>
  <p>FaktumAI uses AI tools, such as language models and AI-assisted development tools, for the following tasks:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Source data analysis and structuring</li>
    <li>Drafting outlines, summaries and translations</li>
    <li>Preparing visuals and image material</li>
    <li>Supporting the site's technical development and quality assurance</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    A human reviews and approves the published content before it goes live. Content is not published automatically without human approval.
  </p>

  <h2>Sources</h2>
  <p>    Sources are cited where possible in editorial content. Claims are separated from interpretation, and significant uncertainties are made explicit.</p>

  <h2>Commercial content</h2>
  <p>Commercial partnerships, sponsored content and advertisements are clearly labelled.</p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>    Errors are corrected in the article by updating the timestamp where necessary. Significant corrections may be communicated separately.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
